## About

I am a Staff Product Designer at Analog Devices, working on digital tools for hardware engineering. With over {% experienceYears %} of experience, I focus on simplifying complex systems and building better user experiences for engineers and enterprises.

I combine my background in design and technology to create interfaces that are both functional and visually appealing. My work spans from UI design to frontend development, allowing me to prototype and implement the solutions I design across the entire product lifecycle. Accessibility is a core part of my process.

